---
// 개발 서버 전용 실험 페이지. astro.config.mjs에서 dev 명령일 때만 /lab/splat/ 경로로 등록한다.
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <title>Splat Lab · 개발 전용</title>
  </head>
  <body class="lab">
    <header>
      <h1>Splat Lab <span>개발 전용 · 3단계 호환성·성능 검증</span></h1>
      <p>PLY는 이 브라우저 안에서만 읽습니다(업로드 없음). 측정값은 아래 "결과 JSON"으로 복사해 기록하세요.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="slots">
      {
        ["a", "b"].map((s) => (
          <fieldset class="slot" data-slot={s}>
            <legend>{s === "a" ? "A · 표준 3DGS" : "B · 제안 방법"}</legend>
            <label>PLY/SPZ 파일 <input type="file" accept=".ply,.spz,.splat,.ksplat,.sog,.zip" data-file /></label>
            <label>또는 URL <input type="text" placeholder="/lab/file/?name=파일명.ply (.lab 폴더) 또는 https://…" data-url /></label>
            <button type="button" data-load>불러오기</button>
            <button type="button" data-unload>비우기</button>
            <dl data-info><div><dt>상태</dt><dd>비어 있음</dd></div></dl>
          </fieldset>
        ))
      }
      <fieldset class="slot">
        <legend>카메라 · 옵션</legend>
        <label>cameras.json (3DGS 학습 출력) <input type="file" accept=".json" data-cams /></label>
        <label>시점 <select data-cam-select><option value="">자유 시점</option></select></label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" data-flip checked /> OpenCV → OpenGL 좌표 뒤집기 (X축 180°)</label>
        <label>보기 <select data-mode><option value="split">A | B 분할</option><option value="a">A만</option><option value="b">B만</option></select></label>
        <label>렌더 해상도 배율 <select data-dpr><option value="1">1×</option><option value="dpr">기기 DPR</option><option value="0.5">0.5×</option></select></label>
        <label>기준 이미지 (원본 렌더러 출력·GT) <input type="file" accept="image/*" data-ref /></label>
        <button type="button" data-psnr="a">A 렌더 vs 기준 PSNR</button>
        <button type="button" data-psnr="b">B 렌더 vs 기준 PSNR</button>
        <button type="button" data-shot>현재 화면 PNG 저장</button>
      </fieldset>
    </section>

    <section class="stage-wrap">
      <div class="stage" data-stage style="--pos:50%">
        <canvas data-canvas="a"></canvas>
        <canvas data-canvas="b"></canvas>
        <span class="divider"></span>
      </div>
      <input type="range" min="0" max="100" value="50" data-split aria-label="A/B 경계" />
    </section>

    <section class="metrics">
      <h2>측정</h2>
      <dl data-metrics></dl>
      <h2>결과 JSON</h2>
      <textarea data-json rows="10" readonly></textarea>
      <button type="button" data-copy>복사</button>
      <h2>로그</h2>
      <ol data-log></ol>
    </section>

    <script>
      import { startLab } from "./splatLab";
      startLab(document.body);
    </script>

    <style is:global>
      body.lab {
        background: #0f1012;
        color: #e8e9eb;
        padding: 16px;
        font-size: 14px;
      }
      .lab header h1 {
        font-size: 20px;
      }
      .lab header h1 span {
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #9aa0a8;
        font-weight: 400;
      }
      .lab header p {
        color: #9aa0a8;
        margin: 4px 0 12px;
      }
      .lab .slots {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 12px;
      }
      .lab .slot {
        border: 1px solid #2c2f34;
        border-radius: 8px;
        display: grid;
        gap: 6px;
        align-content: start;
      }
      .lab label {
        display: grid;
        gap: 2px;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #c9ccd1;
      }
      .lab input[type="text"],
      .lab select,
      .lab textarea {
        background: #1b1d21;
        color: #e8e9eb;
        border: 1px solid #33363c;
        border-radius: 4px;
        padding: 4px 6px;
        font: inherit;
      }
      .lab button {
        font: inherit;
        background: #24272c;
        color: #e8e9eb;
        border: 1px solid #3a3d43;
        border-radius: 4px;
        padding: 4px 10px;
        cursor: pointer;
        justify-self: start;
      }
      .lab dl {
        display: grid;
        gap: 2px;
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 12px;
      }
      .lab dl div {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 11em 1fr;
      }
      .lab dt {
        color: #9aa0a8;
      }
      .lab dd {
        margin: 0;
        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
        word-break: break-all;
      }
      .lab .stage-wrap {
        margin: 12px 0;
      }
      .lab .stage {
        position: relative;
        width: 100%;
        aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
        background: #000;
        border-radius: 6px;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .lab .stage canvas {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
      }
      .lab .stage[data-mode="split"] canvas[data-canvas="b"] {
        clip-path: inset(0 0 0 var(--pos));
        pointer-events: none;
      }
      .lab .stage[data-mode="a"] canvas[data-canvas="b"],
      .lab .stage[data-mode="b"] canvas[data-canvas="a"] {
        visibility: hidden;
      }
      .lab .stage[data-mode="b"] canvas[data-canvas="b"] {
        pointer-events: none;
      }
      .lab .divider {
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        bottom: 0;
        left: var(--pos);
        width: 2px;
        background: #fff;
        pointer-events: none;
      }
      .lab .stage:not([data-mode="split"]) .divider {
        display: none;
      }
      .lab input[type="range"] {
        width: 100%;
      }
      .lab .metrics h2 {
        font-size: 14px;
        margin: 12px 0 4px;
      }
      .lab textarea {
        width: 100%;
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 12px;
      }
      .lab ol {
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #9aa0a8;
        max-height: 200px;
        overflow: auto;
      }
      @media (max-width: 900px) {
        .lab .slots {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </body>
</html>
